    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate the enemy by the thousands, carefully select your upgrade modules, and become the ultimate weapon of destruction in eradicating an unstoppable force in this action roguelite. You alone stand in defiance of the robot scourge, and the odds are overwhelming. Good luck, Space Cowboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Cowboy and the Robot Scourge is a<strong> bullet-heaven roguelite</strong>, focused on an <strong>absurd number of enemies</strong> and <strong>over-powered weaponry</strong>. On your first run you won't stand a chance.\u00a0<strong>Upgrade</strong> your starting stats run over run and <strong>perfect your build</strong> until the Robot Empire crumbles under the relentless might of Space Cowboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay Description:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various weapons during each run and modify them with powerful upgrades from black market vendors. Defeat difficult bosses to progress through increasingly infested star systems and collect Dimensional Shards to upgrade your abilities for future runs.\u00a0 And finally, take the fight to their home world, face the Robot Overlord, and kill the oppression at its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insane power scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate the enemy by the thousands, carefully select your upgrade modules, and become the ultimate weapon of destruction in eradicating an unstoppable force in this action roguelite. You alone stand in defiance of the robot scourge, and the odds are overwhelming. Good luck, Space Cowboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Cowboy and the Robot Scourge is a<strong> bullet-heaven roguelite</strong>, focused on an <strong>absurd number of enemies</strong> and <strong>over-powered weaponry</strong>. On your first run you won't stand a chance.\u00a0<strong>Upgrade</strong> your starting stats run over run and <strong>perfect your build</strong> until the Robot Empire crumbles under the relentless might of Space Cowboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay Description:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various weapons during each run and modify them with powerful upgrades from black market vendors. Defeat difficult bosses to progress through increasingly infested star systems and collect Dimensional Shards to upgrade your abilities for future runs.\u00a0 And finally, take the fight to their home world, face the Robot Overlord, and kill the oppression at its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insane power scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li></ul>",
